{"lauren:Can I come without a book this week?":"c790121a79fb8d74ba760c352192dd7c62bd4be2b31d370d644cf3fc54d92166","siren:A professional body calls its guidance voluntary, while requiring members to explain departures during renewal. Defenders see accountable discretion; critics see an obligation whose sanctions are merely displaced. Both reject a rigid checklist.":"8178ae5b482da5bbf2ddc06fe657dd22729b25e6eddd341b75f805d89ced32e5","lauren:There is agreement that inaction is consequential, but no shared inference about the authority to proceed. A narrowly bounded interim measure might address urgent risks without presenting the consultation as a mandate it did not establish. Any decision should specify its expiry, enforceable safeguards and how absent voices will influence reconsideration.":"5558e3422aebbdc8da8142c003a1652fe9ab9c6a340fd892d1f6b0669367bac3","siren:An online shop plans to make express delivery the default. A small test found fewer abandoned baskets but did not record delivery complaints. Customers must actively select the cheaper option.":"ca6997a77af565f2c155762fefe165454062dc4c098b024966449af34b1b748d","lauren:The room number is fourteen, not forty.":"0c4aaf27c02750d309dc880912a501f80790aebc59d317269bac4adaf012bf89","lauren:I didn't catch the last step; can you say it again?":"3b8268d1d6dc44f1d24bc1971240b0b2685913622c4f8de9886f12dd41bfaec5","lauren:I paid with twenty dollars and got three dollars back.":"5ebf0dd8a2c533ff721f29a8d679922bb3a036582bf0f4e784945ede3e8ed953","lauren:Feel free to ask any questions before we wrap up, so nothing stays unclear.":"3aab3a2426730c2e22002bd07cdf86c536ec4b8c095f766a05b88e0725c52edd"}